<title>SOUTH AFRICA: FORECAST - S.African company results consensus.</title>
<headline>FORECAST - S.African company results consensus.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-04-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Analysts estimates of major South African company results expected next week include the following (all figures cents per share):</p>
<p>DAY--COMPANY---PERIOD--CONSENSUS----RANGE---------PVS-</p>
<p>FRI  Powertech YR EPS  +18 pct    +9-28pct	 36.7*</p>
<p>FRI  Powertech YR DIV  16.7	 15.9-17.2	14.0</p>
<p>FRI  Afrox    YR EPS  37.0	 36.1-37.7	31.4</p>
<p>FRI  Afrox    YR DIV  13.7	 13.3-13.9	11.6</p>
<p>NOTE:- Powertech is expected to restate its previous year figures following the sale of the assets of subsidiary General Technologies Ltd, hence making actual earnings per share forecasts meaningless.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
